{"sha": "02736a92dfbee94a376227d1ce75fd3dfd67db6f192caf246f7702fbc97162ef", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[环绕数]\\label{def:b3:holomorphic:index}", "对闭路径 $\\gamma$ 及 $z \\notin", "\\operatorname{im}\\gamma$，其\\emph{环绕数}\\index{环绕数}", "\\index{路径的环绕数}为", "\\[", "\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(z) = \\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}", "\\int_\\gamma\\frac{\\dd w}{w - z} .", "\\]", "它是\\emph{整数}：令 $\\varphi(t) =", "\\int_a^t\\frac{\\gamma'(s)}{\\gamma(s) - z}\\dd s$，函数", "$(\\gamma(t) - z)\\eu^{-\\varphi(t)}$ 的导数为零，", "（分段），故为常数；取 $t = b$，$\\eu^{\\varphi(b)} =", "\\frac{\\gamma(b) - z}{\\gamma(a) - z} = 1$，故 $\\varphi(b) \\in", "2\\iu\\pi\\Z$。作为 $z$ 的函数，环绕数在", "$\\C\\setminus\\operatorname{im}\\gamma$ 上连续（由控制收敛定理），", "从而在每个连通分支上为常数，且在无界分支上为 $0$（由", "ML 不等式，积分趋于 $0$，当 $z \\to", "\\infty$ 时）。对圆 $\\gamma(t) = a + r\\eu^{\\iu t}$，$t", "\\in \\intcc0{2\\pi}$ 时，$\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(z) = 1$，对 $z", "\\in D(a,r)$（在 $z = a$ 处计算：$\\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}", "\\int_0^{2\\pi}\\frac{r\\iu\\eu^{\\iu t}}{r\\eu^{\\iu t}}\\dd t = 1$；", "由常数性即可得其余部分）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\section{柯西定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[古尔萨定理]\\label{thm:b3:holomorphic:goursat}", "设 $f \\in \\mathcal H(\\Omega)$，$T \\subseteq \\Omega$ 为", "闭三角形区域。则 $\\int_{\\partial T}f\\,\\dd z = 0$", "（边界绕行一次，方向任意）。\\index{古尔萨定理}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设 $I(T) = \\int_{\\partial T}f\\,\\dd z$。连接", "各边中点，将 $T$ 分为四个边长减半的三角形 $T^{(1)},", "\\dots, T^{(4)}$，内部的边两两抵消：$I(T) =", "\\sum_iI(T^{(i)})$。在其中选取 $T_1$，使", "$\\abs{I(T_1)} \\geq \\frac14\\abs{I(T)}$，并迭代此过程，得一嵌套", "序列 $T \\supseteq T_1 \\supseteq T_2 \\supseteq\\cdots$，满足", "\\[", "\\abs{I(T_n)} \\geq 4^{-n}\\abs{I(T)},", "\\qquad", "\\operatorname{diam}T_n = 2^{-n}\\operatorname{diam}T,", "\\quad", "\\operatorname{length}(\\partial T_n) =", "2^{-n}\\operatorname{length}(\\partial T).", "\\]", "交集 $\\bigcap T_n$ 为单点 $z_0$", "（嵌套紧集，直径趋于零，", "由\\cref{thm:b3:topology:compactprops}(3)）。在", "$z_0$ 处可导：任给 $\\varepsilon$，当 $n$ 充分大时，在 $T_n$ 上，", "\\[", "f(z) = f(z_0) + f'(z_0)(z - z_0) + R(z),", "\\qquad \\abs{R(z)} \\leq \\varepsilon\\abs{z - z_0} \\leq", "\\varepsilon\\operatorname{diam}T_n .", "\\]", "仿射部分有原函数，其在闭", "$\\partial T_n$ 上的积分为零（见\\cref{prop:b3:holomorphic:primitive}），", "于是余下", "\\[", "\\abs{I(T_n)} = \\Bigl|\\int_{\\partial T_n}R\\Bigr|", "\\leq \\varepsilon\\operatorname{diam}(T_n)\\,", "\\operatorname{length}(\\partial T_n)", "= \\varepsilon\\,4^{-n}\\operatorname{diam}(T)", "\\operatorname{length}(\\partial T) .", "\\]", "与 $\\abs{I(T_n)} \\geq 4^{-n}\\abs{I(T)}$ 比较：", "$\\abs{I(T)} \\leq \\varepsilon\\cdot\\text{常数}$ 对每个", "$\\varepsilon$，故 $I(T) = 0$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[柯西定理，星形区域版本]", "\\label{thm:b3:holomorphic:cauchy}", "设 $\\Omega$ 关于 $c$ 是\\emph{星形的}（即每条线段", "$[c, z]$，$z \\in \\Omega$，均含于 $\\Omega$） --- 例如凸集。", "每个 $f \\in \\mathcal H(\\Omega)$ 在 $\\Omega$ 上均有原函数；", "从而 $\\int_\\gamma f\\,\\dd z = 0$ 对\\emph{每条}", "闭路径 $\\gamma$ 在 $\\Omega$ 中成立。\\index{柯西定理}", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "定义 $F(z) = \\int_{[c,z]}f\\,\\dd w$。对 $z, z + h \\in", "\\Omega$ 且 $[z, z+h] \\subseteq \\Omega$（对充分小的 $h$ 成立），", "则以 $c, z, z+h$ 为顶点的三角形含于 $\\Omega$", "（星形性：其每一点都落在某线段 $[c,", "w]$，其中 $w \\in [z, z+h] \\subseteq \\Omega$）。由古尔萨定理得", "\\[", "F(z + h) - F(z) = \\int_{[z, z+h]}f\\,\\dd w,", "\\]", "并由差商计算", "（见\\cref{prop:b3:holomorphic:primitive}）得 $F' = f$。闭", "路径积分为零同样由同一", "命题推出。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[柯西积分公式]", "\\label{thm:b3:holomorphic:formula}", "设 $f \\in \\mathcal H(\\Omega)$，$\\bar D(a, r) \\subseteq", "\\Omega$，$C_r$ 为圆周 $\\partial D(a,r)$，沿", "逆时针方向绕行一次。则对每个 $z \\in D(a, r)$：\\index{柯西", "积分公式}", "\\[", "f(z) = \\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}\\int_{C_r}\\frac{f(w)}{w - z}\\,\\dd w .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "固定 $z$，在 $\\Omega$ 上定义", "\\[", "g(w) = \\begin{cases}", "\\dfrac{f(w) - f(z)}{w - z} & w \\neq z,\\\\[4pt]", "f'(z) & w = z :", "\\end{cases}", "\\]", "$g$ 在 $\\Omega$ 上连续，且除 $z$ 外全纯。古尔萨定理", "对 $g$ 在每个三角形 $T \\subseteq \\Omega'$ 上成立，其中", "$\\Omega'$ 为略大于 $\\bar D(a,r)$ 而位于", "$\\Omega$ 内的圆盘：若 $z \\notin T$，直接成立；若 $z \\in T$，则将 $T$", "分成以 $z$ 为顶点的小三角形及", "不含 $z$ 的三角形；在以 $z$ 为顶点的三角形上，ML 不等式给出", "$\\abs{\\int_{\\partial T'}g} \\leq \\sup_{T'}\\abs", "g\\cdot\\operatorname{length} \\to 0$，三角形缩小时，", "其余部分由古尔萨定理知积分为零 --- 因此", "$\\int_{\\partial T}g = 0$ 在一切情形下成立。", "\\cref{thm:b3:holomorphic:cauchy} 的证明只用到了此三角形", "性质：$g$ 在凸集 $\\Omega'$ 上有原函数，因此", "$\\int_{C_r}g = 0$，即", "\\[", "\\frac1{2\\iu\\pi}\\int_{C_r}\\frac{f(w)}{w - z}\\dd w", "= f(z)\\,\\frac{1}{2\\iu\\pi}\\int_{C_r}\\frac{\\dd w}{w - z}", "= f(z)\\operatorname{Ind}_{C_r}(z) = f(z) .", "\\]", "\\end{proof}", ""]}